#~ msgid ""
#~ "75,600 simulated games, nine strategies, three kinds of club — and one "
#~ "clear recommendation."
#~ msgstr "75,600 场模拟比赛、九种策略、三类俱乐部——以及一个明确的建议。"

#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingReport.re.mjs:1010
#, fuzzy
#~ msgid ""
#~ "75,600 simulated games, nine strategies, three kinds of room — and one "
#~ "clear recommendation."
#~ msgstr "75,600 场模拟比赛、九种策略、三类俱乐部——以及一个明确的建议。"

#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingReport.re.mjs:770
#~ msgid ""
#~ "A lopsided match that wastes one side's time. An 11–0 “pickle” is the "
#~ "canonical example."
#~ msgstr "一场一边倒的比赛，浪费了一方的时间。11–0 的「pickle」就是典型例子。"

#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingReport.re.mjs:1120
#~ msgid ""
#~ "A tight club gives the best floor — random dealing manages 61% quality "
#~ "there against 45% in a varied club — at some cost in ranking accuracy, "
#~ "since players who are genuinely close are hard to order. But controlling "
#~ "the roster does not control the matchups: dealt randomly, that same club "
#~ "still blows out 52% of its games; Competitive+ blows out 19% and holds "
#~ "76% quality. The gap exists because skill is not a fixed number. Even "
#~ "hand-picked members fluctuate wildly day to day — improving in bursts, "
#~ "slumping, showing up tired — and a rating system accounts for that in "
#~ "real time, adjusting after every game, so each sessions' matches are "
#~ "built on current form rather than on the level everyone was admitted at. "
#~ "Pkuru keeps hidden ratings even for “unrated” events, so no one's public "
#~ "rating is at stake, and the same ratings pair you with the right drilling "
#~ "partner — even for drills, evenly matched partners matter. (I often "
#~ "prefer a wall: it beats most human drilling partners.)"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "水平接近的俱乐部能提供最好的下限——随机分组在那里能带来 61% 的优质对局，而"
#~ "在水平参差的俱乐部只有 45%——代价是排名准确度下降，因为实力真正接近的球员很"
#~ "难排序。但控制成员构成并不等于控制对阵：同样是随机分组，这家俱乐部仍有 "
#~ "52% 的比赛出现一边倒；而 Competitive+ 的一边倒比例为 19%，优质对局达 76%。"
#~ "差距的根源在于实力并非固定数值。即便是精挑细选的成员，状态也会天天大幅波动"
#~ "——突飞猛进、状态低迷、带着疲惫上场——评分系统会实时反映这些变化，每场比赛后"
#~ "都会调整，因此每次活动的对阵都基于当前状态，而不是入会时的水平。Pkuru 即使"
#~ "在“不计分”活动中也会保留隐藏评分，所以没人的公开评分会受影响，同样的评分还"
#~ "能帮你找到合适的练球搭档——即便是练球，水平相当的搭档也很重要。（我常常更喜"
#~ "欢对着墙练：它胜过大多数人类练球搭档。）"

#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingReport.re.mjs:1191
#~ msgid ""
