#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingReport.re.mjs:761
#~ msgid ""
#~ "In a tight club even the static Competitive+ profile keeps up with "
#~ "Balanced Round Robin almost immediately: when everyone is close, a band "
#~ "drawn from noisy ratings is barely different from one drawn from true "
#~ "skill, so banding costs nothing here. The adaptive Competitive+ tracks "
#~ "Balanced Round Robin from the first round by construction — it runs it "
#~ "until ratings settle. The calibration phase earns its keep in the wider "
#~ "clubs below, where banding on noise genuinely restricts the movement that "
#~ "would fix the ratings."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "在紧密型俱乐部中，即使是静态的 Competitive+ 配置也几乎立刻就能跟上平衡循环"
#~ "赛：当所有人水平接近时，用带噪声的评分划分的分组与按真实水平划分几乎没有差"
#~ "别，因此分组在这里没有代价。自适应 Competitive+ 从第一轮起就与平衡循环赛一"
#~ "致——这是设计使然，它会先运行平衡循环赛直到评分稳定。校准阶段真正发挥作用的"
#~ "是下面差异更大的俱乐部，那里基于噪声的分组会实质性地限制本可修正评分的流动"
#~ "性。"

#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingReport.re.mjs:943
#~ msgid ""
#~ "In a tight club even the static Competitive+ profile keeps up with "
#~ "Balanced Round Robin almost immediately: when everyone is close, a band "
#~ "drawn from noisy ratings is barely different from one drawn from true "
#~ "skill, so banding costs nothing here. The adaptive Competitive+ tracks "
#~ "Balanced Round Robin from the first round by construction — it runs it "
#~ "until ratings settle. With day-to-day form in the world the wider clubs "
#~ "tell a similar story — banding on noisy ratings costs far less than exact "
#~ "numeric balancing gains — so the calibration phase is mostly insurance: "
#~ "it keeps the cold start safe in every club shape without giving anything "
#~ "up here."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "在紧凑型俱乐部里，即便是静态 Competitive+ 配置也几乎立刻就能跟上均衡循环"
#~ "赛：当大家水平接近时，用带噪声的评分划出的分档与用真实实力划出的几乎没有区"
